  "description": "- Extract data as tables or rows from Excel.\n- Search columns by their header or index number.\n- Sets conditions for extracting the rows.\n- Read one or many workbooks.\n- Select what worksheets should be read, by index number or name.\n- Get the result in a DataTable or in a collection of rows.",
  "iconFile": "favpng_wild-boar-icon.png",
  "id": "JdeJabali.JXLDataTableExtractor",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-11T01:21:55.85Z",
